@startuml
[*] --> Idle

Idle : entry / Display current time
Idle --> PowerSelection

PowerSelection : entry / Waiting for user input
PowerSelection --> FullPower
PowerSelection --> HalfPower

FullPower : entry / Full power selected
FullPower --> TimeSetting

HalfPower : entry / Half power selected
HalfPower --> TimeSetting

TimeSetting : entry / Setting cooking time
TimeSetting --> Cooking

Cooking : entry / Cooking in progress
Cooking --> DoorOpen
Cooking --> Cancel
Cooking --> TimeComplete

DoorOpen : entry / Door opened during cooking
DoorOpen --> Idle
DoorOpen : exit / Stop cooking

Cancel : entry / User cancels cooking
Cancel --> Idle

TimeComplete : entry / Cooking time complete
TimeComplete --> Idle

Idle --> [*]

@enduml
